<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Jacket construction — insulation fill, seam sealing, and hardware — is managed on our own floor, letting us hold consistent quality on details that are easy to get wrong, like even down distribution or fully taped seams on waterproof styles. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification applies.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">We work with both down and synthetic insulation, and both DWR-treated water-resistant shells and fully seam-sealed waterproof construction, depending on your product's intended use and price point. Minimum order is 300 pieces per style, with fabric sourcing, sampling, bulk manufacturing, quality inspection, and export documentation included.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Outerwear typically carries higher per-unit value than basics, which makes Bangladesh's trade position proportionally more valuable: continued EU duty-free access under Everything But Arms through November 2029 despite LDC graduation in November 2026, and a 20% US tariff cap from late 2025 that limits exposure versus Chinese-made jackets facing Section 301 duties.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>
